and as a result, the various organs are working. So, if the bonds break away, we will eventually die
各个器官才能正常工作。所以如果这些键断了，我们最终就会死亡，

95
00:15:02,730 --> 00:15:09,730
because of multiple organ failure since the blood carrying the venom will be moving around the body.
死于多器官衰竭，因为携带毒液的血液会在全身流动。

96
00:15:09,730 --> 00:15:19,730
Same thing, remember. So, if radiation also, a person receives a dose of radiation, the same thing is going to happen.
同样的道理，记住，如果辐射也是这样，一个人受到了一定剂量的辐射，同样的事情就会发生。

97
00:15:19,730 --> 00:15:24,730
It's a very dangerous sort of situation. So, we have to learn.
这是一种非常危险的情况，所以我们必须学习。

98
00:15:24,730 --> 00:15:32,730
Now, there can also be a situation where radiation can be useful. Can you tell me how?
也可能存在辐射有用的情况，你们能告诉我怎么有用吗？

99
00:15:32,730 --> 00:15:43,730
You see, these cells that I have been talking about, these are good cells. They are letting me talk to you, letting me take the classroom.
大家看，我一直在讲的这些细胞是好细胞，它们让我能跟你们讲话，让我能上课。

100
00:15:43,730 --> 00:15:51,730
So, I am happy. They are good cells. Now, there can be bad cells as well. Say, for example, cancer cells.
所以我很高兴，它们是好细胞。但也可能有坏细胞，比如说癌细胞。

101
00:15:52,730 --> 00:16:04,730
It's a disease, very dangerous disease. Now, those cells, if we can get rid of, if we can just kill them, that's the best thing.
这是一种疾病，非常危险的疾病。如果我们能除掉那些细胞，如果我们能直接杀死它们，那是最好的。

102
00:16:04,730 --> 00:16:18,730
So, who else can we rely on? Radiation. So, if I put a radiation source near a cancer cell, the cancer cell eats away the radiation,
那我们还能依靠谁呢？辐射。所以如果我在癌细胞附近放一个放射源，癌细胞吸收了辐射，

103
00:16:18,730 --> 00:16:29,730
breaking away bonds, and the cell, cancer cell, which was living away in fashion, enjoying its life in a person's body, making him or her miserable,
化学键断裂，那个在人体内逍遥自在、享受生活、让他或她痛苦不堪的细胞，癌细胞，

104
00:16:29,730 --> 00:16:39,730
the cancer cell dies away, then it's good. So, in a way, radiation can be helpful if it kills away bad cells.
这个癌细胞就会死掉，那就好了。所以从某种意义上说，如果辐射能杀死坏细胞，它就是有帮助的。

105
00:16:39,730 --> 00:16:48,730
But again, remember, cancer cell is not isolated. It will be living in nearly, nearby, healthy cells.
但还是要记住，癌细胞不是孤立的，它会生活在附近的、邻近的健康细胞中间。

106
00:16:48,730 --> 00:16:59,730
So, you have to do this radiation technique. You have to apply in such a way that the good cells are not affected.
所以你必须运用这种辐射技术，你必须以这样的方式应用它，使好细胞不受影响，

107
00:16:59,730 --> 00:17:09,730
Only the harmful cells are affected and killed. Now, what I am saying about affected, there are effectively two ways of affecting the harmful cell.
只有有害的细胞受到影响并被杀死。我说的影响，实际上有两种影响有害细胞的方式。

108
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:21,730
Number one, stop it from doing its multiplication. 1 to 2, 2 to 4, 4 to 8, and so on. Number two, entirely kill it.
第一，阻止它进行增殖，1 变 2，2 变 4，4 变 8，依此类推。第二，彻底杀死它。

109
00:17:21,730 --> 00:17:30,730
So, either you stop the multiplication of the cancer cell, thereby, its size will remain the same. It will not increase.
所以，要么你阻止癌细胞的增殖，这样它的大小就会保持不变，不会增大；

110
00:17:30,730 --> 00:17:38,730
And the second one, the best option is to immediately just kill it. Let it vanish away. So, these are the possibilities.
要么第二种，最好的选择是立即杀死它，让它消失。所以这些就是可能的方式。

111
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:49,730
So, I am again, in a way, telling you the entire thing that health physics is about.
所以，我又从某种意义上把健康物理学的全部内容告诉了你们。

112
00:17:49,730 --> 00:17:57,730
If you have any questions, you can ask. Sometimes, we use different types of radiation to cure a person of some disease.
如果你们有任何问题，可以问。有时我们用不同类型的辐射来治愈一个人的某种疾病，

113
00:17:58,730 --> 00:18:10,730
Say, beta rays we use, alpha particles we use. It all depends on, suppose a person has some particular type of disease, and the cells we need to get rid of.
比如我们用 β 射线，用 α 粒子。这完全取决于，假设一个人得了某种特定的疾病，有我们需要除掉的细胞。

114
00:18:10,730 --> 00:18:23,730
But we know from our study that those bad cells eat away alpha particles of 3 mEV energy very nicely. It's like their biryani.
但我们从研究中知道，那些坏细胞非常喜欢吸收 3 MeV 能量的 α 粒子，这就像它们的印度香饭。

115
00:18:24,730 --> 00:18:35,730
So, let's give them their biryani. Let's give them 3 mEV alpha particles. Now, if you will give them fried rice and chili chicken and all that, they will not eat away like that.
那我们就给它们吃印度香饭，给它们 3 MeV 的 α 粒子。如果你给它们炒饭、辣子鸡之类的，它们就不会那样吃了。

116
00:18:35,730 --> 00:18:44,730
So, instead of 3 mEV alpha particles, if you give them 3 mEV beta particles, it will not work. It will not be as much effective.
所以，如果你不给它们 3 MeV 的 α 粒子，而给它们 3 MeV 的 β 粒子，就不管用，效果没那么好。

117
00:18:45,730 --> 00:19:05,730
So, you are trying to get my point. So, first, you have to understand the cellular operation, what is the need, which organ, how it is affected by what type of radiation, how much dose, how much radiation if absorbed will cause effect, what type of effect will be.
你们明白我的意思了吧。所以，首先你必须了解细胞的运作，需要什么，哪个器官，它如何受到什么类型辐射的影响，多大剂量，吸收多少辐射会产生效应，会是什么类型的效应。

118
00:19:05,730 --> 00:19:19,230
Now, these molecules, when they rupture, there will be changes in the DNA as well. So, these are the things that need to be studied.
这些分子破裂时，DNA 也会发生变化，所以这些都是需要研究的内容。
